  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──そう！　その映画！\r\n結華グッズ買ったのか、やっぱ俺もパンフ買うかぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "パンフ、前に来た時買ったけどよかったよ！\r\n撮り下ろしの写真いっぱいあったし",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "個人的には監督のインタビューがよくてね、\r\n終盤の長回しのとこについての話があって──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うわっ、いいな！\r\nあそこかっこよかったもんな～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──絶対、買いだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よ～しちょっと買ってくる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
