    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110081"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……って思ったけど、結構な時間だったな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは、うん……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110090",
    "autoWaitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "じゃあ、また──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "家まで送るからさ、\r\nその間話せるだけ話すっていうのでどうだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "え、そんな、悪いよ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？\r\nどうせ送っていくし、いい手かなと思ったんだけど──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "送ってくれるのって決定事項なんです！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？\r\nだってこんな時間にひとりじゃ危ないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いやでも、だってＰたん仕事終わりじゃ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？？\r\nああ、だから車じゃなくて悪いんだけど──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あ、歩きのつもりで……！？\r\nそれなおさら、悪いのこっちにじゃなくてＰたんにだし！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………？？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──あっ！？\r\nさすがに鬱陶しいか！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "！？\r\nや、そうじゃなくて──！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だって三峰、Ｐたんに会わなかったら\r\n普通にひとりで帰るわけだったんだし",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そこまで気を遣ってもらうの申し訳ないなと……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ああなんだ、そっちか……！\r\nよかった……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "気を遣うなんてとんでもない\r\n俺が心配なだけだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華がよければ、送らせてくれた方が助かるよ\r\nどうだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011110200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701111/2007011110200"
  },
  {
